Package: captaintvp
Type: Package
Title: Univariate Trend Plus AR Models from CAPTAIN
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Patrick", family = "Brown",
    email = "patrick.borgnine@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Implements the univariate trend plus autoregression routines used by
    the CAPTAIN toolbox air-passenger demonstration. The exported interface follows
    fcast, aic, univ, and univopt, including integrated random-walk smoothing,
    subset AR identification, and sequential spectral decomposition. Kalman
    filtering and fixed-interval smoothing are carried out with 'KFAS'.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: KFAS, stats
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Collate:
    '000.R'
    'fcast.R'
    'state-space.R'
    'ar-identification.R'
    'univ.R'
    'univopt.R'
NeedsCompilation: no
